msgctxt "116"
msgid "Kiryu-san! Hey, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "Hmm? Yuya, what're you doing here?"
msgstr "Hmm? Che ci fai qui?"

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"I come by here for drinks now and then. Man, who's that\r\n"
"cutie with you? On a date? I'm jealous!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "It's not a date. I just happened to run into her here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"Oh, come on, don't be coy! I saw you two over there!\r\n"
"You were really hitting it off!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "Were you listening in, too?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"...Yeah, sorry. I know I shouldn't but when I saw you here\r\n"
"with a cute girl, I couldn't help but get curious!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid ""
"Anyway, so I heard what she was saying about that guy she\r\n"
"likes. Don't you think she's talking about you, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"No, I don't think so. She's just opening up to me about\r\n"
"something she's worried about."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"Come on, that can't be it. I see what's going on here. I'm a\r\n"
"host, after all!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid ""
"See, some girls act like they want to get advice, but really,\r\n"
"what they're doing is trying to figure out how the other person\r\n"
"feels about them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "Is that so?"
msgstr "È così?"

msgctxt "272"
msgid "Remember what she said earlier. First impression: scary guy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "Honest, straightforward gaze."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "A back that hints at a serious past."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "Really strong."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid ""
"That describes you down to the letter, Kiryu-san. Plus,\r\n"
"there's the way she looks at you. It's the exact same way\r\n"
"a girl might look at her celebrity crush."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid ""
"With the way she's been talking to you, it doesn't seem like\r\n"
"she's that inexperienced when it comes to romance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid ""
"There's gotta be a reason why she's not coming out and\r\n"
"telling you how she feels."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr "Cosa intendi?"

msgctxt "380"
msgid ""
"Like, some sort of secret she doesn't want you to know!\r\n"
"For example, maybe she's a single mother, or helping her\r\n"
"parents pay off a ton of debt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid ""
"She might just be curious about how you'll react to that\r\n"
"secret of hers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid "It's how girls gotta do things, sometimes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid ""
"Oh, shoot, she's probably coming back soon! I'll back\r\n"
"off. Good luck!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid "See ya."
msgstr "Ci si vede."

